  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You plant a magical, explosive seed inside a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d10 Fire damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>An explosion then bursts from the target. Each creature in a 60-foot Emanation originating from it (the target excluded) makes a Dexterity saving throw, with Disadvantage if this spell reduced the target to 0 Hit Points. A creature takes 10d10 Fire damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>A nonmagical object in the Emanation that isn’t worn or carried also takes the damage, and it starts burning if it is flammable.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
